{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20333","headline":"赠别孟郊 · 张籍","name":"赠别孟郊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"历历天上星，沉沉水中萍。\n幸当清秋夜，流影及微形。\n君生衰俗间，立身如礼经。\n纯诚发新文，独有金石声。\n才名振京国，归省东南行。\n停车楚城下，顾我不念程。\n宝镜曾坠水，不磨岂自明。\n苦节居贫贱，所知赖友生。\n欢会方别离，戚戚忧虑幷。\n安得在一方，终老无送迎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20333.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20333","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}